# ColorPicker - Storio's one colour picker. Closed: a swatch with the real colour (or gradient). Open: a popover (a
# sheet on a phone) to pick. modes "solid" (default) or "solid gradient"; anims lists the allowed animations.
#   ColorPicker(value: brand, onInput: setBrand)
#   ColorPicker(value: wall, modes: "solid gradient", anims: "flow breathe spin hue", label: "Fondo de la tienda", onInput: setWall)
# The value is paint text (a hex, or "linear 150 | #1a0f0a 0 | #c2410c 100 ~flow 14"). shadcn-for-muten · Custom.
part ColorPicker(value: text, modes: text = "solid", anims: text = "", label: text = "Color", onInput: action) {
  Custom ColorPicker inputs(value: $value, modes: $modes, anims: $anims, label: $label, lang: "es") on(input: $onInput, pick: $onInput) class("cx-cp-host")
}
